# Feature patch 0020 — move or resize a loaded object without a rewrite.
#
#   FPDFRejeb_PageObjTransformInPlace(page, page_object, matrix)
#       → writes the transform as one `cm` right after the `q` of the
#         `q` ... `Q` pair around the object (patch 0017 records it), so
#         the object moves together with the clip and everything else
#         that pair sets up for it, and no other byte of the stream
#         changes. An image sharing its pair with other content gets a
#         pair of its own around its paint operator instead.
#
#   FPDFPageObj_Transform() reaches the file only through a
#   re-serialization of the object's whole content stream.
#
